  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INGEP Increased political participation among     indigenous youth 2010-2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">INGEP &#xd6;kat politisk deltagande bland              urfolksungdomar 2010-2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the strengthening of indigenous young and women in         political parties in Guatemala. The project also aims at increasing   number of voters in the up coming elections in 2011. Independent      observers will be trained. At least 3000 adolescent women and men, in 50 municipalities in 14 departments of the country. Indirect          beneficiaries will amount to around 30,000 and population at large.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xd6;kat deltagande bland unga och kvinnor fr&#xe5;n urfolken, i politiska     partier, valdeltagande och oberoende observat&#xf6;rer inf&#xf6;r valet 2011.   3000 unga i 50 kommuner i 14 distrikt kommer att utbildas, vidare     kommer runt 30,000 indirekta mottagare n&#xe5;s av information om hur man  registrera sig f&#xf6;r att r&#xf6;sta och uppmuntras att r&#xf6;sta,                konfliktprevention &#xe4;r en viktig komponent av st&#xf6;d.</narrative>
  </description>
